From 433d21c19cda9f000f182bbd3d79b80820dc4661 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <usher@gentechsolution.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] j714s: installer kernel freeze (N1 Wi-Fi/BT, T6050 USB/DP
 PHY, cpufreq, idle, G17S GPU profile)

Exact source of the J714s normal-system kernel built by
TripleU613/omarchy-mac-installer (linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora15.j714s2).
Applying this to rolotrealanis98/linux 34f2f5bb4d03 reproduces the frozen
tree byte-for-byte; the raw installer patch is sha256 616d8e7f21f6...

Integrates public work from rolotrealanis98 (T6050 base, J716s DT,
Centauri N1 kernel train, G17S M5 initdata), edimoldovan (J714c T6050
CPU/cpufreq/AFE work), and TripleU613 (J714s DT, N1 host profile, GPU
voltage profile and fuse guard). See docs/installer-stones.md.

Not stacked on patches/linux-aurora: both series carry their own
t6050-j714s.dts layout. Merge map is in docs/installer-stones.md.
